     "text": "Chalkboard Visual Layout:\n      Q.   x(-t + t_01) * delta(-t - t_02) = ?\n\n      -> M-I   x(-t + t_01) * delta(t + t_02) = x[ -(t + t_02) + t_01 ]\n                                              = x[ -t - t_02 + t_01 ]\n\n         M-II  x(t) * delta(t) = x(t)\n               x(-t) * delta(-t) = x(-t)\n\n               x[ -(t - t_01) ] * delta[ -(t + t_02) ] = x[ -(t - t_01 + t_02) ]\n                                                       = x[ -t + t_01 - t_02 ]\n\n      Q.   x(2t) * delta(t - t_0) = ?\n\n      ->   x[ 2(t - t_0) ] = x[ 2t - 2 t_0 ]"
