     "text": "Chalkboard Visual Layout:\n      Q.   y(t) = e^(-t) u(t - 1)  *  u(-t + 1)       h(-tau + t) = u[ -(-tau + t) + 1 ]\n                                      ~~~~~~~~                    = u[ tau - t + 1 ]\n                                        h(t)                      = u[ tau - (t - 1) ]\n\n           y(t) = int_{-inf}^inf x(tau) . h(-tau + t) . dtau\n\n      ->   t - 1 < 1  =>  t < 2\n           y(t) = int_1^inf e^(-tau) . dtau = [ e^(-tau) ]_inf^1 = 1 / e\n\n      ->   t - 1 > 1  =>  t > 2\n           y(t) = int_{t-1}^inf e^(-tau) . dtau = [ e^(-tau) ]_inf^{t-1} = e^(-(t-1))\n\n           Sketches:\n                  ^ x(tau) = e^(-tau) u(tau - 1)\n                  |    |*\n                  |    |  *\n             -----+----+----+-----------------> tau\n                  0    1    inf\n\n                  ^ h(-tau + t) = u(tau - (t - 1))\n                  |          +-----------------\n                  |          |\n             -----+----------+----------------> tau\n                  0         t-1"
