     "title": null,
     "text": "Never evaluate the complete sequence $y[n]$ sample-by-sample when only the total sum $\\sum y[n]$ is requested. Convolving an $L_1$-length sequence with an $L_2$-length sequence requires $L_1 L_2$ multiplications. Using the summation property reduces this to $L_1 + L_2 - 2$ additions, saving critical time in GATE."
