     "tex": "y[2] = -1 + \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right) + \\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)^2 = -1 + \\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{9}{4} = -1 + \\frac{12}{4} = -1 + 3 = 2"
