     "tex": "\\begin{aligned}\n     x_1(t) + x_2(t) &\\longrightarrow [x_1(t) + x_2(t)] + [x_1(t) + x_2(t)]^* \\\\\n     &= x_1(t) + x_2(t) + x_1^*(t) + x_2^*(t) \\\\\n     &= [x_1(t) + x_1^*(t)] + [x_2(t) + x_2^*(t)] \\quad \\checkmark \\quad (\\text{Additivity Holds})\n\\end{aligned}"
