     "t": "math",
     "tex": "x(t) + x^*(t) = 2a(t) \\implies \\boxed{\\frac{x(t) + x^*(t)}{2} = a(t) = \\operatorname{Re}\\{x(t)\\}} \\quad \\checkmark"
