     "text": "                   y(t)\n                     ^\n           \\         |         /\n            \\        |        /\n             \\  m=-1 | m=+1  /\n              \\      |      /\n               \\     |     /\n    -----------------+-----------------> x(t)\n                   (0,0)\n             y(t) = |x(t)|"
