     "t": "math",
     "tex": "\\mathcal{T}\\{a_1 x_1(t) + a_2 x_2(t)\\} = a_1 x_1(|t|) + a_2 x_2(|t|) = a_1 y_1(t) + a_2 y_2(t) \\implies \\boxed{\\text{Linear (L.)}}"
