     "t": "p",
     "text": "Using the sifting property of the Dirac delta $\\int_{-\\infty}^\\infty \\delta(\\tau) f(\\tau) d\\tau = f(0)$:\nHere $f(\\tau) = h(t - \\tau)$. Evaluating at $\\tau = 0$:"
