     "text": "Slides 181 to 210 of Chapter 2 (Basics of Systems) represent a critical pedagogical transition in the PrepFusion curriculum. The lecture unit transitions from the **calculus of responses in discrete Linear Time-Invariant (LTI) systems** into the comprehensive, foundational **Taxonomy of Systems**:"
