     "t": "math",
     "tex": "\\frac{dy_\\beta(t)}{dt} = f(t) \\cdot [3 x_1(t)] = 3 [f(t) x_1(t)] = 3 \\frac{dy_1(t)}{dt} = \\frac{d}{dt}[3 y_1(t)]"
