     "tex": "y_\\alpha(t) = \\left[\\frac{d}{dt}\\{x_1(t) + x_2(t)\\}\\right]^2 = \\left[\\frac{dx_1(t)}{dt} + \\frac{dx_2(t)}{dt}\\right]^2"
