     "text": "Carrier Waveform f(t) = sin(t) with Annihilation Nodes:\n   f(t)\n     ^         +                  +\n     |       /   \\              /     ---+------+-----+------------+-----+------------> t\n     |      0     pi           2pi   3pi\n     |     /       \\          /\n     |    v         v        v\n       delta(t)  delta(t-pi) delta(t-2pi)\nImpulses placed at zeros of sin(t) are wiped out: y(t) = 0."
