     "text": "Analysis of the causal decaying real exponential $x(t) = e^{-t} u(t)$.\n  Queries:\n  (a) Is $x(t)$ an energy signal? $\\to$ **YES** ($E = 0.5\\text{ J}$)\n  (b) Is $x(t)$ Absolutely Integrable? $\\to$ **YES** (Integral = 1)"
