     "t": "code",
     "text": "       CASCADE (SERIES)                             PARALLEL\nx(t)   +----+   +----+   y(t)             +----+\n-----> | h1 |-->| h2 |--->         +----->| h1 |-----+\n       +----+   +----+             |      +----+     |\n      h(t) = h1 * h2               |                 v   +---+ y(t)\n                               x(t)+-------------------->| + |---->\n                                   |                 ^   +---+\n                                   |      +----+     |\n                                   +----->| h2 |-----+\n                                          +----+\n                                       h(t) = h1 + h2"
